# Import / Export Conventions

## Path aliases (use these)

```typescript
import { X } from '@/features/chat'
import { Button } from '@/components/ui/button'
import { streamMessage } from '@/services/ai'
import { cn } from '@/lib/utils'
```

## Rules

- Use `import type` for type-only imports
- Import from module barrel (`index.ts`), not internal paths
- Relative imports (`./`) only within the same module
- No `../../../` cross-module paths

## Forbidden

```typescript
// ❌ Cross-module internal import
import { helper } from '@/features/chat/utils/helper'

// ❌ Wildcard re-exports that pollute namespace
export * from './hooks'
```

## Barrel export template

```typescript
export { MyComponent } from './components/MyComponent'
export { useMyHook } from './hooks/useMyHook'
export type { MyType } from './types'
```
